,{"id":5671834,"review":"Had a great 3-day stay here - clean, comfy and exactly as shown. The location was perfect and safe. The host was super helpful and responsive. Will definitely stay again when we are back in Cairo.","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5715807,"review":"thing went ok","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5727611,"review":"Recommend ❤️","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5740459,"review":"Thank you","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5745263,"review":"محترمين جدا في التعامل","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5750344,"review":"It really a nice place, perfect location, easily accessible. \n\nThe Xuru team were excellent in responding to my enquiries and they did a professional work, the house was full of amenities and all what i need , Thanks","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5763945,"review":"Amazing spot close to everything you need , the place was spotless clean and exactly like photos , easy access and walking distance from shopping centre restaurants and cafes , if you like deserts you have to try Booza and Barad which is 5m walk ! Would love to come back again ! Highly recommended","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z"},{"id":5771759,"review":"Thank you so much for hosting us again! I really appreciated how accommodating and helpful you were throughout the stay — it made a big difference and showed how much you care about your guests. The property itself was beautiful, spacious, and overall very nice, which made the experience enjoyable in many ways.\n\nThat said, my biggest concern was with the cleanliness. I think the place would really benefit from more consistent pest control, cleaner sheets (ideally fresh white ones without stains), and a deeper, more thorough cleaning in general. Paying more attention to these details would elevate the experience a lot and could easily make this a perfect 5-star stay.\n\nBesides those issues, everything else was wonderful, and I truly appreciate your efforts as hosts. Thank you again for having us!","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z"},{"id":5785293,"review":"Thank you","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5812442,"review":"one of the best aprtments in cairo","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z"},{"id":5828213,"review":"My family and I had a comfortable stay at this lovely apartment. There were a few hitches that were quickly resolved by the host. They were attentive and really accessible and responsive via the air bnb app. Would stay again.","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5829256,"review":"Great 👍","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5843813,"review":"Words can’t describe how much I loved this apartment. It’s very clean, beautiful furnished, and the team is always responsive to any inquiries. \nIt will definitely my first choice if I plan to visit Egypt again.","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5851901,"review":"مسكن نضيف وقريب من الخدمات وطاقم متعاون وودود واستجابتهم سريعه واجهك مشكله بسيط وقت الدخول لم يكن هناك شرح وافي لطريقه الدخول او طريقه استخدام شفره المصعد وانحلت مباشره رغم ان وصولي كان في وقت متاخر \nشاكر لكل الطاقم على حسن ضيافتهم","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5855774,"review":"Great","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5863407,"review":"إقامة ممتازة في شقة مرتبة ونظيفة وواسعة وتجهيزاتها مكتملة … التحدي الكبير في المواقف","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5996999,"review":"Ferah ve kullanışlı bir ev","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6023691,"review":"Lägenheten va jätte fin och fräsch hyresvärden är jätte hjälpsamma och svara snabbt","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6131776,"review":"Appartement très agréable, voisinage plutôt calme communication facile avec l’hôte tout le long du séjour.","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6140251,"review":"Because of my too much traveling allover and different countries. I really appreciate this place. Everything they have said  pre hand they are truthful and real. \nThey have alway Prompt response and troubleI shoot immediately if any problem.\nI really enjoyed the matrix with no back pain as usual with the bad quality ones( with other Appatrment). The beds have great bedding, very comfortable.\nVery clean, strong A/C, a lot of spaces, walking in to grocery stores and shopping centres, just walking distance. They are outstanding. Myself my wife loved it. Will come back special with nice and ethical people as Xuru.","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6152857,"review":"Great place to spend quiet time close to shopping.","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6167215,"review":"We had a lovely stay here. The location was great - close to lots of local amenities! The place was as advertised and super clean. Our host was very responsive and attentive and we had a lovely stay!","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"},{"id":6174213,"review":"Positive:\nIt was specious\n\nNegative:\nThe apartment was unkept by the time I was supposed to check in , the wifi was down for sometime, the water and electricity issue","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z"},{"id":6179907,"review":"إقامة مريحة ونظيفة واستجابة سريعة عند طلب خدمة..\nتجربة مفيدة جدا","rental_id":236874,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:43.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}